2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (The\040Iberian\040electricity\040market\072\040analysis\040of\040the\040risk\040premium\040in\040an\040illiquid\040market)
/Author (Márcio\040Ferreira\054\040Helder\040Sebastião)
/Subject (This\040paper\040analyzes\040the\040risk\040premium\040in\040the\040base\055load\040monthly\040futures\040contracts\040traded\040on\040the\040Iberian\040electricity\040market\040\050MIBEL\051\040between\040July\0401\054\0402006\040and\040March\04031\054\0402017\056\040During\040this\040time\040span\054\040the\040ex\040post\040risk\040premium\040on\040the\040last\040trading\040day\040presented\040a\040relative\040mean\040value\040of\040\0555\07277\045\040as\040well\040as\040negative\040skewness\054\040excess\040kurtosis\040and\040some\040persistence\056\040The\040risk\040premium\040depended\040on\040the\040season\040of\040the\040year\054\040with\040the\040absolute\040value\040for\040winter\040futures\040being\040more\040than\040five\040times\040higher\040than\040for\040summer\040futures\056\040The\040absolute\040risk\040premium\040and\040its\040volatility\040decreased\040nonlinearly\040throughout\040the\040remaining\040trading\040days\040until\040maturity\056\040There\040is\040no\040statistical\040evidence\040for\040rejecting\040an\040unbiased\040forward\040hypothesis\073\040however\054\040the\040sequence\040of\040futures\040prices\040approaching\040maturity\040showed\040some\040predictive\040power\040as\040regards\040the\040risk\040premium\056\040The\040futures\040price\040path\040between\040seven\040and\040three\040days\040prior\040to\040delivery\040explained\040around\04028\045\040of\040the\040variability\040in\040the\040risk\040premium\054\040and\040there\040is\040some\040evidence\040that\040this\040information\040can\040be\040used\040to\040successfully\040forecast\040the\040risk\040premium\040signal\056)
/Keywords (28\040Jun\0402018\054\040The\040Journal\040of\040Energy\040Markets\054\040Risk\040premium\054\040Electricity\040market\054\040Futures\040contract)
>>
endobj
